<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<script>document.documentElement.classList.add('js');</script>
<title>arXiv system status</title>
<meta property="og:image" content="https://arxiv.org/static/base/1.0.1/images/arxiv-logo-primary-light.svg">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="screen" href="./static/arXiv.css"/>
<!-- ARXIVCE-4426: shared spinout chrome (CSS/JS/images) is consumed from the
     versioned arxiv-base static route, NOT vendored. status.arxiv.org is a single
     prod-only deployment (no dev twin), so the prod host is fixed here. -->
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="screen" href="https://static.arxiv.org/static/base/1.0.1/css/arxiv-header-footer.css?v=20260626"/>
<link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://arxiv.org/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon"/>
<style>
  /* This status page is short; pin the footer to the bottom of the viewport
     (sticky-footer layout). Status-specific — kept out of the shared chrome CSS. */
  body#front { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh; }
  #content { flex: 1 0 auto; }
  .ds-site-footer { flex-shrink: 0; }
</style>
</head>

<body id="front">
<a href="#content" class="ds-skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

<div class="ds-announcement" id="announcement-banner" role="region" aria-label="Announcement" data-banner-name="spinout-nonprofit">
  <img class="ds-announcement-glyph" src="https://static.arxiv.org/static/base/1.0.1/images/icons/smileybones-small.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="ds-announcement-text">arXiv is now an independent nonprofit!</span>
  <a class="ds-announcement-link" href="https://info.arxiv.org/about">Learn more</a>
  <button type="button" class="ds-announcement-close" aria-label="Dismiss announcement">&times;</button>
</div>

<header class="ds-site-header">
  <a href="https://arxiv.org/" class="ds-site-header-logo" aria-label="archive home">
    <img src="https://static.arxiv.org/static/base/1.0.1/images/arxiv-logo-primary-light.svg" alt="archive">
  </a>
  <button type="button" id="ds-nav-toggle" class="ds-site-header-nav-toggle" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="ds-site-header-nav" aria-expanded="false">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
  </button>
  <nav class="ds-site-header-nav" id="ds-site-header-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a id="arxiv-search-toggle" href="https://arxiv.org/search" aria-controls="arxiv-search-overlay" aria-expanded="false">
      <svg class="ds-nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
      Search
    </a>
    <a href="https://arxiv.org/user/create">Submit</a>
    <a href="https://info.arxiv.org/about/donate.html">Donate</a>
    <span class="ds-site-header-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <a href="https://arxiv.org/login" class="ds-site-header-login">Log in</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="arxiv-search-overlay" id="arxiv-search-overlay" hidden>
  <div class="arxiv-search-panel" role="search">
    <form method="GET" action="https://arxiv.org/search">
      <label for="arxiv-search-input" class="is-sr-only">Search arXiv</label>
      <input type="text" name="query" id="arxiv-search-input" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Search papers by title, author, abstract, or ID...">
      <input type="hidden" name="searchtype" value="all">
    </form>
    <div class="arxiv-search-hint">Press Enter to search &middot; <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/advanced">Advanced search</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="content">
<h1>arXiv.org Operational Status</h1>
<ul>
<li>✅ Up - arxiv.org - Main Site; Postscript downloads temporarily disabled</li>
<li>✅ Up - Search</li>
<li>✅ Up - export.arxiv.org</li>
<li>✅ Users are able to log in and submit papers</li>
<!--
<li>⚠️ Users can log in and submit papers; show-email and show-endorsers are temporarily disabled</li>
-->
</ul>
<!--
❌ Down -
✅ Up -
  Partly working -
-->

<h1>ORCID Related Maintenance</h1>

<h2>2026-08-11</h2>

<p>There will be maintenance related to ORCID features:</p>

<p>Tues, August 11th, 2026, between 9AM and 5PM EDT</p>

<p>We are doing work related to ORCID. All other arXiv services remain
available. There may be a period of minutes during which the ORCID linking is
not available to users. After which time it will be available again. This will
only affect logged in users who want to newly connect their ORCID iD to arXiv,
it will have no effect on users who have already connected them.</p>

